# A single window (`ui.md`, "Fenêtres"): every window shares one model, so
# a second one would only mirror the first. No menu item opens another
# window: no File > New Window (⌘N), no window tabs and their "+".
# `expect` waits up to 5 s: SwiftUI builds the menus after the launch.
# The menu bar is built (app, File, Edit, View, Window, Help…): an empty
# list below is not read before the menus exist.
expect menu_count > 4
expect window_tabs = false
expect window_openers =
